@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Read workspace list and overview
actor "Signed-in user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "ProjectListPage / WorkspaceListView\nor ProjectLayoutPage / ProjectHeaderView\nwith ProjectOverviewPage / WorkspaceOverviewView\nand BoardModeGuard" as page
  participant "IWorkspaceService / WorkspaceService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "WorkspacesController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "ListWorkspacesQueryHandler\nGetWorkspaceQueryHandler" as handler
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Open Projects (optionally ?responsibleLeadId from a lead's View all), change page or Clear filter, or open an overview
page -> page : Route query or route ID reaches the view's input; its query signal changes at once (no debounce); show skeleton; announce "Loading projects" / "Loading project"
page -> client : workspacesResource reads ListWorkspacesQuery (page, pageSize 25, responsibleLeadId?), or the header's and the overview view's workspaceResource each read GetWorkspaceQuery (id); each resource is created once in its view's injection context
opt The view's previous read is still in flight
  client -> client : Unsubscribe the superseded request; HttpClient cancels it; it updates no state
end
client -> access : GET /api/workspaces?page=&pageSize=&responsibleLeadId= or GET /api/workspaces/{id}
alt Overview route ID is not a GUID
  access --> client : 404 from API routing: the {id:guid} route constraint matches no endpoint; no authorization, controller, or handler runs
  client --> page : Resource status error (404); the header keeps only the breadcrumb; the overview view shows "Project not found" with Back to projects
else List query or well-formed ID
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid, or expired JWT; inactive account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : Navigation to sign-in destroys the view, which cancels its read; this route is restored after sign-in
else Signed in (profile P: both roles read workspaces)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send query through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : L2-045 page >= 1; pageSize 1-100; responsibleLeadId well-formed when present
  alt Page below 1, or page size zero, negative, or above 100 (an edited link)
    validation --> ctrl : 400 page or pageSize field message; nothing read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Resource status error (400); the field message with Clear filter (all projects, page 1), as in lead-filter-invalid; no rows or paging; no Try again or reference ID; announce the message
  else responsibleLeadId is malformed
    validation --> ctrl : 400 responsibleLeadId field message; nothing read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Resource status error (400); lead-filter-invalid state with Clear filter; no Try again or reference ID
  else Valid list query, responsibleLeadId names no lead
    validation -> handler : Handle ListWorkspacesQuery
    handler -> db : Read the filter lead's ID and name
    db --> handler : No lead
    handler --> ctrl : 400 responsibleLeadId field message; no list read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Resource status error (400); lead-filter-invalid state: "That lead no longer exists, so projects can't be filtered by them", Clear filter (shows all projects); no Try again or reference ID
  else Valid list query
    validation -> handler : Handle ListWorkspacesQuery
    opt responsibleLeadId supplied
      handler -> db : Read the filter lead's ID and name
    end
    handler -> db : One projection statement: page ordered by name then ID (lead filter if any), window total, set-based story done/total, active sprint or paused flag; no descriptions
    db --> handler : Bounded rows and total from one statement
    handler --> ctrl : WorkspaceList (items, totalCount, page, pageSize, responsibleLead?)
    ctrl --> client : 200
    client --> page : Resource status resolved; value holds the WorkspaceList for the current query
    alt No workspaces and no filter
      page --> actor : Empty state: administrators get New project; collaborators learn who can add one
    else Filtered by responsible lead
      page --> actor : "Projects led by" the lead's name, full matching count, Clear filter, and paging as usual
    else Total above page size
      page --> actor : Cards, "Showing 1-25 of N", Previous/Next and page links
    else Single page
      page --> actor : Cards with mode, lead, story progress, and sprint summary
    end
  else Valid overview query
    validation -> handler : Handle GetWorkspaceQuery
    handler -> db : Begin one snapshot read transaction; load workspace settings, version, and responsible lead
    alt Workspace missing (deleted or mistyped link)
      db --> handler : No row
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing else read
      ctrl --> client : NotFound ProblemDetails
      client --> page : Resource status error (404); the header keeps only the breadcrumb, with no alert; the overview view shows "Project not found" with Back to projects and focuses its heading; its first notFound makes ProjectOverviewPage call ProjectLayoutPage.refresh(), so a header that still showed the project rereads
    else Workspace found
      handler -> db : Type-by-status counts, per-type totals, and the work-item total over every persisted work item
      alt Scrum mode
        handler -> db : Active sprint (name, goal, dates, done/total stories)
        handler -> db : Next planned sprint (earliest start date, then ID); latest closed sprint's recorded outcome (latest closure, then ID)
      else Kanban mode
        handler -> db : Kept planned and closed sprints by planned start date, newest first, then ID; at most 25
        handler -> handler : Flag each kept sprint paused
      end
      db --> handler : Persisted projection
      handler --> ctrl : WorkspaceDetail
      ctrl --> client : 200
      client --> page : Resource status resolved; value holds the WorkspaceDetail
      page --> actor : Header with name, mode, lead, and the tabs for the mode (the header emits workspaceLoaded); Project actions only with workspaces.manage, else the Collaborator notice; overview settings, counts linked to filtered work, and the sprint or board summary
    end
  end
end
end
opt Board tab opened
  page -> client : BoardModeGuard (canMatch) awaits loadMode(workspaceId): GET /api/workspaces/{id}, authorized as above
  alt Mode read
    client --> page : The workspace's delivery mode
    page -> page : Match KanbanBoardPage in Kanban mode or SprintBoardPage in Scrum mode
  else 404 (project deleted or mistyped)
    client --> page : The promise rejects with the 404
    page -> page : The guard returns a UrlTree to overview, whose view shows "Project not found" with Back to projects
  else 500 or 503, or no response
    client --> page : The promise rejects
    page -> page : The guard sets RouteContext.status to Error with the response's reference ID, or to Offline when no response came, and returns false from canMatch; a declined canMatch skips its route instead of cancelling the navigation, so with both board routes skipped the router matches the shell's ** route and completes the navigation at the board URL, outside the project layout
    page --> actor : ApplicationShell shows ShellStatusView with the status the guard set, not the Not found of that route, because the status clears when a navigation starts, not when it ends
    actor -> page : Try again
    page -> page : Navigate to the attempted board URL with onSameUrlNavigation 'reload'; that navigation's start clears the status, and route matching runs BoardModeGuard again
  end
end
opt Sprints route, and the resolved header has no Sprints tab (Kanban with no kept sprints)
  page -> page : ProjectLayoutPage navigates to overview, replacing the URL; while one of its dialogs is open it defers this until the dialog closes
end
opt Unexpected failure (network, SQL, or server)
  client --> page : Resource status error: 500 or 503 with correlation ID, or no response
  alt Projects list, or the overview view's read (the header may have failed too and shows its compact alert)
    page --> actor : Load-failed state with Try again; a 500 or 503 adds its reference ID and Copy; no response shows no reference ID and the shell's offline banner appears; no empty layout
    actor -> page : Try again
    page -> client : WorkspaceListView calls reload() on its workspacesResource; WorkspaceOverviewView emits retryRequested, and ProjectOverviewPage calls ProjectLayoutPage.refresh() (revision + 1), so ProjectHeaderView and the overview reread their workspaceResource together
  else ProjectHeaderView's read (the active tab's view keeps whatever its own read returned)
    page --> actor : The header keeps the breadcrumb and shows a compact alert under it: "We couldn't load this project's details", the reference ID only when a response carried one (500 or 503), and Try again; announced as an alert; no name, tabs, or Project actions
    actor -> page : Try again
    page -> client : ProjectHeaderView emits retryRequested; ProjectLayoutPage maps it to refresh() (revision + 1), so the header and the active tab's view reread together
  end
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
